ent wrapper, bind handlers, visible tasks, control flow, HMR, eager resume) are","+  `_inlinedQrl(fn, 'q_<hash>', [captures])` calls, with `inlinedQrl as _inlinedQrl` imported from","+  `shared/qrl/library-qrl.ts`; the build turns that import into `@qwik.dev/core`. Never create them","+  with `createQRL(null, '_x', fn)`: the optimizer must see them to give them a chunk and a dev URL.","+  Add each hash to `CORE_QRL_HASHES` and match core QRLs by hash, not symbol (prod renames `q_run`","+  to `s_run`). Make `fn` a function declaration: the Rust optimizer's SSR output calls `.s(fn)` at","+  the top of the module. Give the QRL a name different from `fn`'s, or dev segments redeclare it."," "," ## Focused Verification"," "],"additions":20,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"e2e/qwik-e2e/apps/qwikrouter-ssg-snapshot/expected.ssg.html","lines":["@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@","-<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" q:render=\"static-ssr\" q:route=\"/\" q:container=\"paused\" q:runtime=\"2\" q:base=\"/build/\" q:locale=\"\" q:manifest-hash=\"MANIFEST_HASH\" q:instance=\"[instance]\" :><head :><link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"/build/q-xxxxxxxx.js\" :><script type=\"text/javascript\">import(new URL(\"/build/q-xxxxxxxx.js\",document.baseURI).href)</script><link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"/build/q-xxxxxxxx.js\" :><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/assets/xxxxxxxx-bundle-graph.json\" as=\"fetch\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" :><script type=\"module\" async crossorigin=\"anonymous\">window.addEventListener('load',f=>{f=_=>{let b=fetch(\"/assets/xxxxxxxx-bundle-graph.json\");import(\"/build/q-xxxxxxxx.js\").then(({l})=>l(\"/build/\",b))};requestAnimationFrame(_=>requestAnimationFrame(_=>{typeof requestIdleCallback==='function'?requestIdleCallback(f,{timeout:1000}):requestAnimationFrame(_=>setTimeout(f))}))})</script><link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"/build/q-xxxxxxxx.js\" :><meta : charset=\"utf-8\"><meta : name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><link : rel=\"canonica